/*!
    \module HiddenFriendsReject
    \brief Module for rejected class-template hidden-friend \\fn commands.
*/

/*!
    \class QualifiedProbe
    \inmodule HiddenFriendsReject
    \brief A template class whose hidden friend takes a fixed qualified type.

    The \a T parameter specifies the element type.
*/

/*!
    \fn template <typename U> void qualifiedCheck(QualifiedProbe<U> &a, ConcreteTypes::U &b) noexcept

    Rejected qualified-type marker. Checks \a a and \a b.

    This command must not document the hidden friend. The friend takes
    ConcreteTypes::T, a fixed type whose final name component merely
    shares a name with the class's template parameter; ConcreteTypes::U
    is a different fixed type. Renaming the parameter cannot turn one
    into the other.
*/
